# Track only docs plus Assets/Scripts and Assets/Scenes (and their .meta)
*
.DS_Store

!.gitignore
!*.md

!Assets/
!Assets/Scripts/
!Assets/Scripts/**
!Assets/Scenes/
!Assets/Scenes/**
!Assets/Animates/
!Assets/Animates/**
!Assets/Characters/
!Assets/Characters/**
!Assets/Cozy Furniture – Chairs & Seats Pack/
!Assets/Cozy Furniture – Chairs & Seats Pack/**
!Assets/Ducogen/
!Assets/Ducogen/**

!Assets/Scripts.meta
!Assets/Scenes.meta
!Assets/Scripts/**.meta
!Assets/Scenes/**.meta

# allow only specific StreamingAssets CSVs
!Assets/StreamingAssets/
!Assets/StreamingAssets/Audio/
!Assets/StreamingAssets/Audio/**/
!Assets/StreamingAssets/Audio/**/expInfo_*.csv
!Assets/StreamingAssets/Audio/**/expInfo_*.csv.meta
!Assets/StreamingAssets/**.csv
!Assets/StreamingAssets/**.csv.meta
!Assets/StreamingAssets/ExpMaterial/
!Assets/StreamingAssets/ExpMaterial.meta
!Assets/StreamingAssets/ExpMaterial/**.csv
!Assets/StreamingAssets/ExpMaterial/**.csv.meta
!Assets/StreamingAssets/ExpMaterial/**.wav
!Assets/StreamingAssets/ExpMaterial/**.wav.meta

!ProjectSettings/
!ProjectSettings/**
!Packages/
!Packages/**

._*